00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:50.400
gender, race or anything. Of course, it's&nbsp;
terrible. And I just I hope that there's more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:57.680
light that is shined on those people, you know,&nbsp;
on on anybody that goes missing. And I also hope&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:03.440
for some sort of healing for, you know, Gabby's&nbsp;
Gabby's family and and people who loved her. And,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:07.440
yeah, it's just it's terrible all around&nbsp;
anybody who goes missing. But thank&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:10.789
you so much for your time, David. I really&nbsp;
appreciate you. Big fan of the show. Thanks.&nbsp;

00:04:10.789 --> 00:04:15.120
Speaker 1: Will Will from L.A. very much.&nbsp;
Appreciate the call. And a good topic. I mean,&nbsp;&nbsp;

